Chapter: ItemDesigner

 Item asset generator for weapons, armor, potions, and artifacts.
 Emits HTML through the plug pipeline. Controls for item type,
 rarity, material, and enchantment. Outputs on dark background
 suitable for inventory UI icons.

 We say:

Section: Item Types

  ItemCategory = record {
    name : Text,
    prompt-fragment : Text
  }

  item-categories : List ItemCategory
  item-categories = [
    ItemCategory { name = "Sword", prompt-fragment = "ornate fantasy sword, long blade, detailed crossguard and pommel" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Axe", prompt-fragment = "heavy fantasy battle axe, double-headed, carved haft" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Staff", prompt-fragment = "magical wizard staff, crystal orb top, carved runes along shaft" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Shield", prompt-fragment = "ornate fantasy shield, heraldic emblem, battle-worn edges" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Helm", prompt-fragment = "fantasy helmet with visor, ornamental crest, forged metal" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Ring", prompt-fragment = "magical ring, gemstone setting, intricate band engravings" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Potion", prompt-fragment = "glass potion bottle, glowing liquid inside, cork stopper, magical mist" },
    ItemCategory { name = "Scroll", prompt-fragment = "ancient scroll, unfurled parchment, glowing arcane symbols" },
